# Root .dockerignore — applies to all builds (build context = repo root).
# Keeps build contexts lean. Each Dockerfile only COPYs the paths it needs.

.git
.github
docs

# Dependencies / build artifacts (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache

# Local env & secrets (provided at runtime instead)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Runtime data & logs
data
**/logs
**/*.log

# Editor / OS noise
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea
**/.vscode
